    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Warehouse where the goods transferred for quality control are placed by registering a request. If the goods are placed in several warehouses, leave the field empty</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>انباری که کالای منتقل‌شده برای کنترل کیفیت با ثبت درخواست در آن قرار می‌گیرد. اگر کالا در چند انبار قرار دارد، فیلد را خالی بگذارید</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Склад, на котором размещены товары, передаваемые на контроль качества посредством оформления заявки. Если товары размещены на нескольких складах, поле необходимо оставлять пустым</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Talep düzenlenerek kalite kontrole aktarılan ürünlerin bulunduğu ambar. Ürünler birden fazla ambarda bulunuyorsa, alan boş bırakılmalıdır.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Warehouse where the goods transferred for quality control are placed by registering a request. If the goods are placed in several warehouses, leave the field empty</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Warehouse where the goods transferred for quality control are placed by registering a request. If the goods are placed in several warehouses, leave the field empty</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Warehouse where the goods transferred for quality control are placed by registering a request. If the goods are placed in several warehouses, leave the field empty</value>
