  <attributes uuid="848bb138-2b5b-44de-95bb-596ec23324d1">
    <name>ReasonForGoodsLock</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Goods lock reason</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>دلیل قفل کالا</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Причина блокировки товара</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Ürün bloke nedeni</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Goods lock reason</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Goods lock reason</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Goods lock reason</value>
    </synonym>
    <type>
      <types>CatalogRef.GoodsLockReasons</types>
    </type>
    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Reason why it is decided to check the quality of goods in the warehouse. If the controlled lot was generated earlier, when the goods arrive at the warehouse, select the predefined &quot;Incoming quality control&quot; reason</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>علت تصمیم به بررسی کیفیت کالا در انبار. اگر لات کنترل‌شده قبلاً هنگام ورود کالا به انبار ایجاد شده است، علت از پیش تعریف‌شده &quot;کنترل کیفیت ورودی&quot; را انتخاب کنید</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Причина, по которой принимается решение о необходимости проконтролировать качество товаров на складе. Если контролируемая партия была сформирована ранее, при поступлении товаров на склад, необходимо выбирать предопределенную причину &quot;Входной контроль качества&quot;</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Ambardaki ürünlerin kalitesinin kontrol edilmesi gerektiğine karar verme nedeni. Kontrol edilen lot daha önce, mal girişinde oluşturulmuşsa, önceden tanımlanmış “Giriş kalite kontrolü” nedeni seçilmelidir.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Reason why it is decided to check the quality of goods in the warehouse. If the controlled lot was generated earlier, when the goods arrive at the warehouse, select the predefined &quot;Incoming quality control&quot; reason</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Reason why it is decided to check the quality of goods in the warehouse. If the controlled lot was generated earlier, when the goods arrive at the warehouse, select the predefined &quot;Incoming quality control&quot; reason</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Reason why it is decided to check the quality of goods in the warehouse. If the controlled lot was generated earlier, when the goods arrive at the warehouse, select the predefined &quot;Incoming quality control&quot; reason</value>
    </toolTip>
    <minValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <maxValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <fillChecking>ShowError</fillChecking>
    <fillValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <fullTextSearch>Use</fullTextSearch>
    <dataHistory>Use</dataHistory>
  </attributes>
  <attributes uuid="8fcf0119-91c5-4f9c-ab5e-68bbed2448c3">
    <name>ToScheduleGoodsUnlock</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Schedule goods unlock</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>زمان‌بندی رفع قفل کالاها</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Планировать разблокировку товаров</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Ürün blokesinin kaldırılmasını planla</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Schedule goods unlock</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Schedule goods unlock</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Schedule goods unlock</value>
    </synonym>
    <type>
      <types>Boolean</types>
    </type>
    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Select the checkbox if it is assumed that the goods being transferred for control can be considered of high quality. In this case, the planned date of goods quality confirmation will be recorded in the system. Otherwise, goods unlocking will not be scheduled in the system.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>اگر فرض بر این است که کالای منتقل‌شده برای کنترل می‌تواند باکیفیت تلقی شود، کادر را انتخاب کنید. در این صورت، تاریخ برنامه‌ریزی‌شده تأیید کیفیت کالا در سیستم ثبت خواهد شد. در غیر این صورت، آزادسازی کالا در سیستم برنامه‌ریزی نخواهد شد.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Если предполагается, что товар, передаваемый на контроль, может быть признан качественным в результате контроля, необходимо установить флаг. В этом случае в системе будет отражена плановая дата подтверждения качества товара. В противном случае разблокировка товара не будет запланирована в системе</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Kontrole aktarılan ürünün kontrol sonucunda kaliteli olarak kabul edilebileceği öngörülüyorsa, onay kutusu işaretlenmelidir. Bu durumda sistemde ürün kalitesinin onaylanması için planlanan tarih yansıtılacaktır. Aksi takdirde, sistemde ürünün kilidinin açılması planlanmayacaktır.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Select the checkbox if it is assumed that the goods being transferred for control can be considered of high quality. In this case, the planned date of goods quality confirmation will be recorded in the system. Otherwise, goods unlocking will not be scheduled in the system.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Select the checkbox if it is assumed that the goods being transferred for control can be considered of high quality. In this case, the planned date of goods quality confirmation will be recorded in the system. Otherwise, goods unlocking will not be scheduled in the system.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Select the checkbox if it is assumed that the goods being transferred for control can be considered of high quality. In this case, the planned date of goods quality confirmation will be recorded in the system. Otherwise, goods unlocking will not be scheduled in the system.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <minValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <maxValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <fillValue xsi:type="core:UndefinedValue"/>
    <fullTextSearch>Use</fullTextSearch>
    <dataHistory>Use</dataHistory>
  </attributes>
  <attributes uuid="c9ae6031-0d35-4639-a9a8-6a88cab4d154">
    <name>QualityConfirmationDate</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Quality confirmation date</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
