      <toolTip>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Controlled lot generated when the goods arrive at the warehouse. It is filled in for requests for quality control of the received goods when the reason for goods locking specified in the request is &quot;Incoming quality control&quot;</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>لات کنترل‌شده ایجادشده هنگام ورود کالا به انبار. برای درخواست‌های کنترل کیفیت کالای دریافت‌شده زمانی تکمیل می‌شود که علت قفل کالا در درخواست &quot;کنترل کیفیت ورودی&quot; باشد</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Контролируемая партия, сформированная, при поступлении товаров на склад. Заполняется для заявок на контроль качества поступившего товара, когда в заявке указана причина блокировки товара &quot;Входной контроль качества&quot;</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Mal girişinde oluşturulan kontrol edilen lot. Talepte ürün kilitlenme nedeni “Giriş kalite kontrolü” olarak belirtildiğinde, girişi yapılan ürünün kalite kontrol talepleri için doldurulur.</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Controlled lot generated when the goods arrive at the warehouse. It is filled in for requests for quality control of the received goods when the reason for goods locking specified in the request is &quot;Incoming quality control&quot;</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Controlled lot generated when the goods arrive at the warehouse. It is filled in for requests for quality control of the received goods when the reason for goods locking specified in the request is &quot;Incoming quality control&quot;</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
